  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></math> be such that the equation, <math><mi>a</mi><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has a repeated root <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo></math> which is also a root of the equation, <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo></math> If <math><mi>&#946;</mi></math> is the other root of this equation, then <math><msup><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> is equal to:"
  },
